=== CPU-build negative control for the CUDA execution witness ===
2026-09-27T17:48:57+00:00
small-refmac-machine
A CPU-only build must refuse --gpu with a named error. This is what makes the
SCARF native-CUDA witness falsifiable: the marker cannot be printed by a
build that has no CUDA in it.

--- main ---
CUDA:BOOL=OFF
